{"about_the_game":"<strong>Welcome to Nothing To Declare</strong>  <br>Ever wondered what it\u2019s like to work airport security... without the stress? In <i>Nothing To Declare</i>, you step into a cozy, hand-drawn world where your job is to keep things safe, with just a sprinkle of suspicion.<br><br>From weighing luggage to scanning x-rays and questioning quirky travelers, every shift brings surprises (and the occasional questionable electronic device). Use your judgment and intuition to decide: do you let it through\u2026 or unzip and investigate?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894850/extras/67023d62737b266654a447ec25833af9.poster.avif?t=1774501362\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894850/extras/67023d62737b266654a447ec25833af9.webm?t=1774501362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894850/extras/67023d62737b266654a447ec25833af9.mp4?t=1774501362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf3 Your Daily Routine:</h2>  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Start Your Shift:</strong> Begin your day at the cozy airport checkpoint or behind-the-scenes baggage station.<br></li><li><strong>Serve Passengers:</strong> Greet travelers, check passports, weigh bags, and scan them for suspicious items.<br></li><li><strong>Investigate Further:</strong> If your gut says something\u2019s off, dig in, literally. Unzip luggage and search with care in mini-game form.<br></li><li><strong>Grade Your Performance:</strong> Make smart calls, earn money, and avoid penalties for mistakes. Or don't, chaos is also an option.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894850/extras/a9ef7b72e1651634d56c6db25cafc218.poster.avif?t=1774501362\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894850/extras/a9ef7b72e1651634d56c6db25cafc218.webm?t=1774501362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894850/extras/a9ef7b72e1651634d56c6db25cafc218.mp4?t=1774501362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d Mini-Games You\u2019ll Master:</h2>  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Bag Weighing:</strong> Check if a suitcase is pushing the limits\u2026 and guess what might be inside.<br></li><li><strong>X-Ray Scanning:</strong> Layered, noisy bag visuals hide secrets, can you spot the danger?<br></li><li><strong>Passenger Interviews:</strong> Choose from dialogue options to assess each traveler\u2019s intent and honesty.<br></li><li><strong>Luggage Searching:</strong> Unzip, poke around, and carefully examine every odd-looking item.<br></li><li>...and more as the airport grows!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894850/extras/b78ee6e059066516849c2439769517b7.poster.avif?t=1774501362\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894850/extras/b78ee6e059066516849c2439769517b7.webm?t=1774501362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894850/extras/b78ee6e059066516849c2439769517b7.mp4?t=1774501362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Features &amp; Feel:</h2>  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hand-drawn 2D visuals full of charm and character.<br></li><li>Mini-games inspired by real security tasks, but make it cozy.<br></li><li>Light narrative elements with funny or suspicious passengers.<br></li><li>Endless replayability as each shift brings new challenges.<br></li><li>Packed (literally) with items from the Lost But Found universe, and more!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2708\ufe0f Ready to start your shift?</h2>  <br>There\u2019s <i>nothing</i> to declare\u2026 except a good time. (sorry for the bad joke)<br><br><strong>\ud83d\udeeb Wishlist now to be notified when the free demo is ready for boarding!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894850/extras/02c768392f426205a27a9add40f2b7e4.avif?t=1774501362\" width=1560 height=460 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3894850?t=1774501362","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3894850?t=1774501362","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894850/47a509b4c0b4f8307fd0fc0460dcd3afb5169fdc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774501362","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894850/47a509b4c0b4f8307fd0fc0460dcd3afb5169fdc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774501362","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3981090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist &amp; Play the demo first! \u2728</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894850/extras/02c768392f426205a27a9add40f2b7